# This directory contains auto-generated and indexed docs of all local crates and all
# dependencies in json format. It is designed to be consumed by agents, particularly via
# the `read-the-docs` skill but may be useful for other use cases too.

# Including the generated docs adds huge noise when comparing branches, so we only keep the
# shell scripts needed to generate the docs and accept the few minutes it takes to re-generate
# after a fresh clone
*
!*.sh

# in case anyone changes this file in future
!.gitignore

# allow for any .sh files later placed in sub-directories
!*/
